        "text_N4uy6EMxfWDbw8KT": "<p><strong> Quit Naturally, No Nicotine</strong></p>",
        "text_cp370CkLv0BCjoNB": "<p>50.000+ Happy customers</p>",
        "text_TmEVFoKDdYcZzW27": "<p><strong>100% Natural</strong></p>",
        "text_ChACOIaiAN2vMSiC": "<p><strong>NO tax or duties</strong></p>",
        "product_V9c70HtoQJsrc9qi": "",
        "text_k2vP8UYM1rbIpJ3W": "<p>🤩 50.000+ Quit</p>",
        "text_qLu3FkV0KsTX63bO": "<p>🚫 No Nicotine</p>",
        "text_65jxiEMFGq5Rlp6I": "<p>🍃 100% Natural</p>",
        "text_XKpu94iPvPhL3Jnl": "<h3>Journey pack</h3>",
        "text_AkEdLnDyUkvrIGko": "<p>trusted by 50,000+ people</p>",
        "text_HRzrI9RXRX7bclMo": "<h3>Step 1: SELECT your Lio</h3>",
        "text_AoxKo41zM9c9BvNN": "<h3>Crafted from premium Olive wood.</h3>",
        "text_Pgsgg8CmsdARU5R8": "<h3>Crafted from premium walnut wood.</h3>",
        "text_QELC2gngRoZOFePs": "<h3>Durable, easy to clean, and built for longer-lasting flavours.</h3>",
        "text_miPyvP1glMmz6vRP": "<h3>Durable, easy to clean, and built for longer-lasting flavours.</h3>",
        "text_n1GpOOXwuak9mKC1": "<h3>Made of stainless steel, with a magnetic adjustable airflow system and built-in fidget feature.</h3>",
        "text_ofJzJv8rrLZBcYb3": "<h3>Made of stainless steel, with a magnetic adjustable airflow system and built-in fidget feature.</h3>",
        "text_doanp6mLlr90F0CI": "<h3>Step 2: SELECT your PACK</h3>",
        "text_F146MV0KoGSyjq95": "<h3>SOLO</h3>",
        "text_cZtWwBVW1oaSM4b1": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Olive Wood Lio</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_sycogzLKGlKV6z5m": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Wanut Wood Lio</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_r6L4bS6rHXr47VtD": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Silver Aluminium Lio</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_53dPcEazkPuCyffS": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Black Aluminium Lio</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_T8dzr8F1wHYAIoFH": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Gen 2 Silver</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_NPn1VaQJrvW3zqX3": "<h3><strong>1x </strong>Gen 2 Black</h3><h3><strong>1x</strong> Habit Tracker </h3><h3><strong>1x </strong>60-day Supply (18 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_w3Z2xE0BXrlibseR": "<h3>Together</h3>",
        "text_24KuDVe7n3a1UgfF": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Olive Wood Lio </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_98C8nKkKAqtG4BrM": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Walnut Wood Lio </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_7v6HC9kH4PSSI6Mx": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Silver Aluminium Lio </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_49FFd41D3VAI53yj": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Black Aluminium Lio </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_aIr7U0INDaGNK8o5": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Gen 2 Silver </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_zbymTgqUCVeLcaII": "<h3><strong>2x </strong>Gen 2 Black </h3><h3><strong>2x</strong> Habit Tracker</h3><h3><strong>2x </strong>60-day Supply (36 Cores)</h3>",
        "text_rm4M2VqLOO7183z1": "<p>ADD TO CART</p>",
        "text_CKNzLKCOvqmqPoEH": "<p>Didn&apos;t quit in 30 Days? Money Back!</p>",
        "text_DPPBbMc9DhYQFVc8": "<h3><strong>Free Shipping</strong></h3>",
        "text_tNaqkn8Yz1UWn3HR": "<h3>Worldwide</h3>",
        "text_LzbsFNtHD8zObheg": "<h3><strong>Delivery</strong></h3>",
        "text_VPDdIIhtbVw6pswg": "<h3>2-5 Days</h3>",
        "text_dgDSpNXTiVU07bpI": "<p><strong>Safe &amp; Secure Payments</strong></p>",
        "text_e7WNLFnFpXCJcmQG": "<p><strong>40% of people also add:</strong></p>",
        "product_BTPUI7e8Cngbd8sy": "",
        "text_ZTLcII8R5Xu8N0Vb": "<h3>Classic Complete </h3>",
        "text_kaSkMfArpfPxLCwH": "<p>60 days of Flavour Cores</p>",
        "product_wUyM0myuoDVnOnsR": "",
        "text_PlP5deaLj5XHs2Li": "<h3>Classic Olive </h3>",
        "text_TIOGsSvfqyQjgCY0": "<p>Premium Olive Wood</p>",
        "product_VRMovKR5ta0iEtKa": "",
        "text_3XBiCcDJs8sR6FZA": "<h3>Classic Walnut </h3>",
        "text_831l7tnImgCgoYAw": "<p>Premium Walnut Wood</p>",
        "text_bdAzYskZzY087yTA": "<h3>Any Questions?</h3>",
        "text_cXgyDFKFn3ejxkud": "<h3>We&apos;ve got answers</h3>",
        "text_3BLlohVl8M9GzU2G": "<p><strong>What does flavoured air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_H5ug3QSrRiH2K5Or": "<p>Lio’s flavoured air provides a subtle, natural taste designed to help you quit smoking or vaping. </p><p></p><p>It’s less intense than vapor but refreshing, similar to a lightly infused herbal tea or soda without the sweetness.</p>",
        "text_woVvqi0duUCR4MDD": "<p><strong>How does Lio work?</strong></p>",
        "text_OMTMSfoZU0N5yccb": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored air to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it keeps the hand-to-mouth habit for an easy transition. </p><p></p><p>Trusted by 50,000+ customers and backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee, it’s the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>",
        "text_MKOxgHV6b4Ak0zhU": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_t8QyaS4Jsm5JyDy1": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings.</p></li></ol>",
        "text_sqWK43Uk7fIcOplL": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_9LPH9OWWzelowjHu": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_PH3iWjbnJcvsAiVh": "<p><strong>Money Back Guarantee</strong></p>",
        "text_TeazFZGAewHZrqzQ": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_cuXEtgK88rJrobyb": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>",
        "text_wPTvD6tvJNigCklW": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_y64WbemKmFrNF3f9": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>",
        "text_YOkuUhgqd46IHgxp": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>",
        "text_FPlfhGmhSjRlnYFN": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_HMl4h2aHXkSo8kZS": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
        "text_aoSGDJfWNNVYIPSr": "<h3>FREE YOURSELF</h3>",
        "text_mZJcBHuneIQRfAVq": "<h3><strong>from nicotine, vapour, </strong></h3><h3><strong>smoke and toxins.</strong></h3>",
        "text_Jq3JuuxO6oBm7Bz7": "<h3>FREE YOURSELF</h3>",
        "text_KDTPVPCU4N2rxkxW": "<h3><strong>from nicotine, vapour, </strong></h3><h3><strong>smoke and toxins.</strong></h3>",
        "text_Np5R0hbQn6LJSndT": "<h3>Over 50.000+</h3><h3>Success Stories</h3>",
        "text_aon17A2x83WNQlZj": "<p>With 92% success rate, Lio is 2.5x more effective then other methodes.</p>",
        "text_koMZ47GhQ526ZTBt": "<h3>Didn't Work?</h3><h3>Money Back.</h3>",
        "text_YrrLdNU2XjX5CpgW": "<p>We’re so confident in Lio, that if it didn't work, you’ll get your money back.</p>",
        "text_4LEvYCDQ7Vrki5hM": "<h3>100% Natural & </h3><h3>Chemical-Free</h3>",
        "text_iirxNyN6pvI3zuU7": "<p>A completely natural way to curb cravings without smoke, vapor, or nicotine.</p>",
