        "text_kpoGqIxevAgO765K": "<p>Order Now</p>",
        "product_kN0vxFPj29MEu9gs": "lio®-journey-pack",
        "text_DuT6btstlrAD33Sj": "<h3>THE ONLY</h3>",
        "text_pGnwVLkds4vtbSd8": "<h3><strong>ALTERNATIVE</strong></h3>",
        "text_o4MyHAUjHyu8ZB5n": "<h3><strong>\"Why is quitting so hard?\"</strong></h3>",
        "text_hlZGd6JGNFh5HykF": "<p><strong>Because most quitting methods rely on nicotine, keeping you stuck in the cycle of addiction. </strong></p><p></p><p>Lio, is different—no nicotine, no chemicals, just natural flavoured air that curbs cravings while keeping the familiar hand-to-mouth motion.</p>",
        "text_TskhN2J1BqbUiaH7": "<h3>World's first</h3>",
        "text_NQxRzGr4WFAIddGT": "<h3>Flavoured</h3>",
        "text_2Ww7mEbBhCRGlSLa": "<h3><strong>AIR DIFFUSER</strong></h3>",
        "text_xbWPJL3Ko8v36AdA": "<h3>World's first</h3>",
        "text_SHe4afi0xW9ejK0s": "<h3>FLAVOURED</h3>",
        "text_XTisEVd4FV121IfD": "<h3>AIR DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_maAqJC3sKxRoOOSm": "<h3>\"The diffuser that’s transforming the way people quit smoking & vaping for good.\"</h3>",
        "text_yE0L3qPW4G7yLocO": "<p>Quitting smoking or vaping isn’t easy, but Lio simplifies it by focusing on what truly works.</p><p></p><p>Unlike other solutions that rely on nicotine or chemicals, Lio helps you <strong>curb cravings naturally</strong> while preserving the familiar<strong> hand-to-mouth habit</strong>.</p><p></p><p>No need for cold turkey or frustration with methods that fall short.</p><p></p><p>With Lio, you get a <strong>natural</strong>, <strong>stress-free way</strong> to break free—without side effects.</p><p></p><p>It’s a tool designed to support your journey, making quitting feel achievable and empowering every step of the way.</p>",
        "text_3Wvsa2nU5GXe7FpW": "<p>Order Now</p>",
        "url_r3SWW80vyE4R8OLe": "#i8OngKHzZJAeAmUQf",
        "text_OXFLX5LeCqcQy7wC": "<p>Order Now</p>",
        "text_OyBaFHgryyahPlG2": "<p>Didn't quit in 30 Days? Money Back!</p>",
        "text_D1gYFFbtkaFTti6q": "<p>Rated 4.7/5 out of 400+ reviews</p>",
        "text_TCArSmRUeoMAM10a": "<h3>what our customers say</h3>",
        "text_ppMcRbOdqqVXM6JE": "<p>Discover the incredible </p><p>success stories our customers.</p>",
        "text_dkNJPQhkefsnWSE8": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_L3od1Crue5wvSe5q": "<p>Absolute game-changer!</p>",
        "text_Sax2G77ozyCBKBSo": "<p>\"3 months nicotine-free thanks to Lio! The customer service was exceptional. I'm grateful for this product on my journey to quit smoking💪\"</p>",
        "text_1stRdwu3PjXlltLW": "<p>Sofie Povis</p><p>(5 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_Bxg9ocYXL4Er0LRj": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_CjPlRy1dhWpbzhs3": "<p>Helps me stay off cigs!</p>",
        "text_YttRYcr3Gj4XV0os": "<p>\"Lio has been an excellent replacement to curb my cravings. Lost my device, but they quickly sent a replacement—great product and service!\"</p>",
        "text_euN5khwjQchBSQ1U": "<p>Josje Laan</p><p>(18 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_2iLwhie421bgrymV": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_e3PEyVyzoHB1Pjd0": "<p>Lio saved my life</p>",
        "text_bwBdXQRjxQg2OgPP": "<p>I was smoking almost 20 cigarettes per day. I tried lots of expensive ways to quit smoking but unfortunately without results. I decided to try Lio and in 2 weeks I'm only using this. Without anxiety crisis.</p>",
        "text_Bn9iQsDdHcpKZ2Dl": "<p>Pedro Kawal</p><p>(18 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_RyMKNBRhGPJaNbpZ": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_4JC6Dn4oHNfkXNFm": "<p>I quit after 35 years</p>",
        "text_gj2JraZpVZasw7NM": "<p>\"After seeing my colleague with his Lio, I took the plunge. I had been a smoker for 35 years and quitting was hell. With Lio it goes without saying, although I don't leave my house without it.\"</p>",
        "text_I1qweXUELmpeY6gj": "<p>Koen Bakker</p><p>(16 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_ryhFSp5yCOuaJPRU": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_5oWnlqXcgfiMWYJE": "<p>Simple & Effective</p>",
        "text_rwU7cVcwlnJpqd9p": "<p>\"After a week of using Lio, I already feel the difference. No smoke, no nicotine—just something to keep my hands busy guilt-free. A true lifesaver!\"</p>",
        "text_7l64FqSkWbcNa95p": "<p>Zakaria Ernst</p><p>(9 Days Ago)</p>",
        "url_6fUNGjPhoUudNexl": "#i8OngKHzZJAeAmUQf",
        "text_RmQVjAkxnHkOAhtQ": "<p>Order Now</p>",
        "text_hTO4gbNs9ZkL1wdX": "<h3>THE LIO DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_iEQVMMtxAw81PSIk": "<h3>EXPLAINED</h3>",
        "text_0uvOjvxApNLzJsKF": "<h3><strong>\"Using Lio is as simple as it gets—designed for ease and effectiveness.\"</strong></h3>",
